### 🚀 PART 3: SEO, METADATA & VIRAL GROWTH STRATEGY

Sirf copyright se bachna kaafi nahi, views lane ke liye ye metadata strategy use karein:

#### 1. Title Formula (CTR Badhane Ke Liye)
*   **Hook + Keyword + Emotion:** "Builder Ne 16 Lakh Ka Scam Kiya? 😱 | Taarak Mehta Funny Scene"
*   **Length:** Max 50-60 characters. Mobile par pura dikhna chahiye.
*   **Avoid:** "Episode 759", "Part 1" jaise boring titles.

#### 2. Description Optimization
*   **First 2 Lines:** Main keywords + hook sentence (ye search results mein dikhta hai).
*   **Timestamps:** Agar long video hai to chapters dalein.
*   **Hashtags:** Max 3-5 relevant hashtags (#TMKOC #Comedy #Shorts). Zyada hashtags spam maane jaate hain.
*   **Keywords:** Natural sentences mein keywords dalein, list mat banayein.

#### 3. Tags & Keywords
*   **Mix:** Broad (Comedy, Hindi Serial) + Specific (Taarak Mehta Episode 759, Jethalal Quotation) + Misspelled (Tarak Mehta, TMKOC funny).
*   **Tools:** TubeBuddy ya VidIQ se trending tags nikalein.

#### 4. Thumbnail Strategy
*   **Face + Text:** Character ka expressive face + bold text (max 3-4 words).
*   **Contrast:** Bright colors (Yellow, Red) use karein.
*   **No Clutter:** Thumbnail par watermark ya extra text na dalein.

#### 5. Engagement Hacks
*   **Pinned Comment:** Question puchein ("Aapke hisaab se 16 lakh sahi tha? Comment karo!").
*   **End Screen:** Related video link karein watch time badhane ke liye.
*   **Community Tab:** Polls daalein ("Kaunsa scene best laga?") audience engage karne ke liye.

