5.  **❌ Missing Safety Check:** Rix ya koi bhi tool pre-upload scan nahi kar raha.
6.  **❌ Generic Hashtags:** #faltu #usekaroge jaise tags dead hain. #TMKOC #Jethalal #HindiComedy use karne chahiye the.
7.  **❌ No Audio Modification:** Original audioそのまま hai. Pitch/speed change nahi kiya.
8.  **❌ Single Source Dependency:** Sirf TMKOC par depend hai. Agar ye channel block hua to poora system down.

