Aapka current approach (**Unlisted Buffer + Region-Block Hold + Claim Feedback Loop**) ekdum production-grade system ki taraf ja raha hai. Yahan kuch suggestions hain jo aapke legit workflow ko aur robust bana denge:

### 1. Unlisted Buffer Logic Optimization
*   **Dynamic Wait Time:** Har video ke liye fixed 10 mins wait mat karo. Video ki length aur complexity ke hisaab se wait time adjust karo (e.g., <30s clips = 5 mins, >60s = 15 mins).
*   **Retry Mechanism:** Agar Content ID API timeout ya error de, to turant fail mat karo. Exponential backoff (2 min → 4 min → 8 min) ke saath retry karo.
*   **Partial Block Threshold:** Sirf "Blocked" check mat karo. Ek config variable banao `MAX_ALLOWED_BLOCK_PERCENTAGE` (e.g., 10%). Agar block isse kam hai to public karo, warna reject/trim karo.

### 2. Claim Feedback Loop (Self-Healing System)
Yeh sabse powerful feature hai jo aap build kar rahe hain:
*   **Claim Type Classification:** API se claim type (`audiovisual`, `audio`, `composition`) fetch karo.
    *   *Audio Claim:* Auto-mute segment ya YouTube Audio Library replace trigger karo.
    *   *Visual Claim:* Auto-trim specific timestamp ya blur overlay add karke re-render karo.
*   **Source Blacklisting:** Agar kisi source/channel se लगातार 3 baar claim aaye, to us source ko automatically "High Risk" list mein daal do aur future downloads skip karo.
*   **Variant Generation:** Claim aane par original clip ke 2 variants auto-generate karo:
    *   Variant A: Trimmed version (claimed part removed)
    *   Variant B: Muted/Replaced audio version
    *   Dono ko unlisted upload karke check karo, jo safe ho usse public karo.

### 3. Metadata & SEO Safety (Legit Growth)
Copyright se bachna zaroori hai, par views lana bhi zaroori hai. Legit tareeke se metadata optimize karein:
*   **Transformative Titles:** Original show name ki jagah topic-based titles use karein.
    *   ❌ "TMKOC Episode 759 Clip"
    *   ✅ "Builder Scam Exposed! 😱 | Real Estate Truth"
*   **Fair Use Description Template:** Har video description mein automated fair use disclaimer add karein with context-specific commentary note.
*   **Tag Strategy:** Broad + Specific tags mix karein par spammy tags avoid karein. TubeBuddy/VidIQ API integrate karke trending tags fetch karein.

### 4. Testing & PROGRESS.md Best Practices
